211	              /* Downgrades refund and were never self-service. Said plainly on
212	                 the one control that can reach them, rather than given a card
213	                 of its own that exists only to say no. */
214	              <p className="text-[12.5px] text-tx-faint">
215	                Moving down refunds the difference, which we handle by hand —{" "}
