     the unprefixed one out entirely for our browser targets and nothing
     renders — confirmed earlier with a temporary probe, not a guess. Lens
     distortion (--lens) stays unchained from this for now — plain blur is
     what was asked for; the per-card <GlassFilters> mounts are still there
     to bring it back later without re-plumbing anything. */
